{"id":"u-862a791f-60c2-4765-99c8-e04187f8f4ad","src":"community","title":"REDEMPTION: 28-3","author":"Jon Bon Giorno, PhD","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/9xj7Kd-redemption-1","desc":"You were counted out. Left behind. Maybe you fell off your training. Maybe you never got the respect you knew you deserved. This isn’t just another hypertrophy program—this is your four-day warpath back to dominance.\n\nInspired by Tom Brady’s legendary 28-3 Super Bowl comeback, this split is built for those chasing muscle with a chip on their shoulder. Every rep is a response. Every pump is a promise. This is about more than size—this is about redemption.\n\nWhat's Inside:\n\n🔥 4 ruthless days — chest/back, legs, arms, and delt domination\n\n💥 High-volume, no-fluff programming designed to carve dense, defined muscle\n\n🧠 Strategic intensity techniques (supersets, slow eccentrics, top sets) to break plateaus\n\n🛡️ Recovery dialed in to keep you in the fight—no burnouts, no excuses\n\n🏁 Progression built to storm the scoreboard week after week\n\nThis is the split for people who train like they're behind. Because in your head, you still are.\n\nRun it if you’re ready to stop talking and start building.","level":["Intermediate"],"goals":["Muscle"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":40,"joins":0,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-03-14T14:14:24.893Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Upper 1 (Chest focus)","Lower 1 (Heavy day)","Upper 2 (Arms focus)","Lower 2 (Volumizer/Pumpsville)"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"ss":[{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Smith Machine)","sets":[{"r":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Chin-Up (Weighted)","sets":[{"r":15,"x":3}],"note":"Neutral grip"}]},{"n":"Chest Fly (Cable)","sets":[{"r":15,"x":3}]},{"n":"Shoulder Press (Machine)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":2}]},{"ss":[{"n":"Preacher Curl (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":15,"x":3}]},{"n":"JM Press","sets":[{"r":8,"x":3}]}]},{"ss":[{"n":"One Arm Lateral Raise (Cable)","sets":[{"r":12,"x":3}]},{"n":"Rear Delt Fly (Cable)","sets":[{"r":12,"x"